# Compiled catalogs — the release build runs `pnpm i18n:compile`, so these are
# generated from the .po files rather than committed. Committing them means
# reviewing a binary diff and, eventually, shipping one that no longer matches
# its source.
#
# The .mo files are named for the locale alone, not the text domain: WordPress
# looks for "{locale}.mo" when the catalog directory lives inside the theme.
# See bin/i18n/compile.sh.
*.mo
laao-*.json
